// Tower: a slab of apartments, 16 x 12 m. Balconies in two colored stacks in the middle of the
// long faces, air conditioners and cages on the outer bays, shops on every street story; blank
// side walls with a fire escape. Tall ones step back to a narrower top of double windows.
// Elevations are seen from outside, the top story first and the street story last (docs/chunks.md,
// "Towers"); seen from outside the front (-z), bays run from x = 20 down to x = 4.
